WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.981
Auxiliary verbs do, be and have help form questions, negatives and verb phrases.

00:00:04.981 --> 00:00:07.923
Match each auxiliary to the subject and tense.

00:00:08.783 --> 00:00:13.642
Which sentence correctly uses do as a helping verb? Answer: Do they play after

00:00:13.642 --> 00:00:13.989
school?

00:00:14.867 --> 00:00:20.093
Say or write three questions using do/does, is/are and has/have correctly.

00:00:20.950 --> 00:00:23.766
The plural subject they takes do and a base verb.
